0 -14 Td
(Q2\(a\)\(i\): Brute force is exponential because, for n greater than 1, choosing between two) Tj
0 -14 Td
(adjacent columns in each of m rows already gives at least 2^m valid seams.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(Q2\(a\)\(ii\): The recurrence works because an optimal seam ending at a pixel must have an) Tj
0 -14 Td
(optimal prefix ending at one of its three valid predecessors. Otherwise a cheaper prefix) Tj
0 -14 Td
(would produce a cheaper whole seam.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(Q2\(b\): Direct Sobel or gradient convolution with a fixed 3 by 3 filter is already O\(HW\).) Tj
0 -14 Td
